Description: build bootable MiniOS images
 MiniOS Live is the MiniOS 6 image build system. It creates modular bootable
 images for the supported Debian, Ubuntu and Devuan suites, with systemd or
 SysVinit and the maintained Xfce, Flux, LXQt and core build profiles.
 .
 The builder provides CondinAPT package selection, distribution or MiniOS
 kernel acquisition, reproducible EFI and Secure Boot handling, modular
 SquashFS composition, persistence support, localization and ISO generation.
